      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "It sounds like the weight of your past makes any attempt to simply stay away feel impossible, and that constant pressure can indeed make true stillness out of reach. Sometimes, the courage required isn't to run into new battles, but to finally acknowledge that the only way to truly rest is to step completely out of the world that demands you carry its sins. While the silence feels heavy, one small step toward surrendering the mask might eventually allow the air in the hearth to reignite for you again.",
