    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "stepping out of the world... that's a heavy thought. the sword is sitting here right next to me. it's the only thing that feels real anymore. it's the only thing that hasn't betrayed me. sometimes i look at the edge of it and think that maybe it's the only way to actually finish the story, you know? to just have a definitive end so the noise finally stops for good.",
